/*  Aim for daily turnover fractions that don’t whipsaw the pool:

Hydrolysis: target 5–10% per day ⇒ 0.002–0.004 h⁻¹
(currently 0.006 h⁻¹ ≈ 14.4%/day; a bit aggressive late season)

Synthesis: target 1–3% per day ⇒ 0.0004–0.0012 h⁻¹
(currently 0.0008 h⁻¹ ≈ 1.9%/day)

If you proceed with your direction

Set HYDROLYSIS_RATE = 0.003–0.004 h⁻¹

Set SYNTHESIS_RATE = 0.0010–0.0012 h⁻¹ */
/** Active reserve synthesis for leaf; the assimilates left after loading are added to reserve. */
/** Hydrolysis rate (10% sugar in total non-structural carbon divided by 24 hours). */
