using Fraction of water flux reduction to adjust the carbon allocation under drought to achieve a balance in transpiration and water uptake.

When the root and soil is not limiting the potential transpiration, check the transpiration and conductance balance, and see whether shoot allocation needs to be increased. 

WATER_STRESS_THRESHOLD_RS_ADJUSTMENT = 0.85;
*/
global float FLUX_REDUCTION_THRESHOLD_RS_ADJUSTMENT; // 0.85
//********************************* plant-water *********************************/

